        "description": "Identification of pathogenic variants in genes such as SLC26A2 (Achondrogenesis Type IB) or COL2A1 (Type II)",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of severe short-limbed dwarfism with absent or poor vertebral ossification and pulmonary hypoplasia",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is primarily clinical and radiological; genetic testing can confirm subtype."
